[9.928, "o", "\u001b[2;3;36m# Every label Auto Mode lets a NodePool select on: family, size, vCPUs, memory, generation, GPUs. The\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.978, "o", "\u001b[2;3;36m# closest to speed is the vendor's clock rate. Nothing on measured performance, caches, or what a unit\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.028, "o", "\u001b[2;3;36m# of performance costs; and Karpenter launches the cheapest allowed type.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
